## 6️⃣ TL;DR – One-liner fix

```javascript
// Replace this (old callback style)
map.loadImage(url, (err, img) => { if (err) throw err; map.addImage('pin', img); });

// With this (promise style)
map.loadImage(url).then(({ data }) => map.addImage('pin', data));
```

Add the call inside a `map.on('load', …)` handler (or after any style change) and you’ll see your markers again.

